// The order of a hash is not defined. keys() can answer in a different order
// on every run, so anything that depends on the order has to sort.
//
// Make this print:
//
//   2
//   ["a", "b"]
//
// The second line has to be the same on every run, so sort it.

h = {"a": 1, "b": 2}

puts(h.size())
